simadaosheng:p001","quote":"會稽思世子道生，字延長。帝為會稽王，立道生為世子，拜散騎侍郎、給事中。性疏躁，不修行業，多失禮度，竟以幽廢而卒，時年二十四，無後。及孝武帝即位，嘗晝日見道生及臨川獻王郁，鬱曰：「大郎饑乏辛苦。」言竟不見。帝傷感，因以西陽王錄玄孫珣之為後。珣之曆吳興太守。劉裕之伐關中，以為諮議參軍。時帝道方謝，珣之為宗室之美，與梁王珍之俱被害。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro:p001:m0010","surface":"會稽思世子道生","start":10,"end":17,"person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0000","surface":"會稽思世子道生","start":0,"end":7,"person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0015","surface":"道生","start":15,"end":17,"person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0033","surface":"道生","start":33,"end":35,"person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-daosheng-mother","subject_person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","object_person_id":"xyg_gy3_92q","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"王皇后生會稽思世子道生、皇子俞生"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro-ws2622004","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro:p001","quote":"簡文帝七子：王皇后生會稽思世子道生、皇子俞生。胡淑儀生臨川獻王郁、皇子朱生。王淑儀生皇子天流。李夫人生孝武帝、會稽文孝王道子。俞生、朱生、天流並早夭，今並略之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-jianwen-sons-intro:p001:m0010","object_perso